    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you reach a Sorcerer level specified in the Clockwork Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><p>In addition, choose or randomly determine from the Manifestations of Order table how your connection to order manifests while you cast any of your Sorcerer spells.</p><h4>Manifestations of Order</h4><table><thead><tr><th>1d6</th><th>Manifestation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Spectral cogwheels hover behind you.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>The hands of a clock spin in your eyes.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Your skin glows with a brassy sheen.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Floating equations and geometric shapes overlay your body.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Your Spellcasting Focus briefly takes the form of a Tiny clockwork mechanism.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>You and those affected by your magic hear gears ticking or a clock chiming.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
